<![CDATA[Hi {!Contact.FirstName},<br><br>Thank you for taking time to discuss the financing needs for {!Account.Name}.&nbsp; I’m looking forward to preparing a financing quote for you.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br><br> <a href="http://www.nationalfunding.com/?utm_source=SF%20Emails&amp;utm_medium=Email&amp;utm_campaign=CoolProspect">National Funding's</a> financing programs are designed to help small businesses like {!Account.Name} with reasonable credit standards and most fund within a few days. &nbsp;<div><br>To finalize your quote, fax or email the following information to my attention at {!User.Fax} or&nbsp;<span style="font-size: 12pt;">{!User.Email}&nbsp;</span><span style="font-size: 12pt;">and I can follow up with a full quote by the next business day:</span></div><div><ul><li>Your New or Used Equipment Quote</li><li>Your completed Express Verification Form</li></ul><p>I'm looking forward to earning your business.<br><br>Sincerely,<br><font size="4"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman,Times,Serif; font-style: italic; font-weight: bold;">{!User.Name}</span></font><br><br><font style="font-family: Arial,Sans-Serif; font-weight: bold;" size="4"><span style="font-style: italic;"></span></font><span style="font-family: Arial,Sans-Serif; font-weight: bold;"> </span>{!User.Name}<br>{!User.Title}<br><a href="http://www.nationalfunding.com/?utm_source=SF%20Emails&amp;utm_medium=Email&amp;utm_campaign=CoolProspect">www.nationalfunding.com</a><br>P: {!User.Phone} | F: {!User.Fax}<br>Email: {!User.Email}<br><br><font color="#CC0000" size="1">Follow Us on: </font><br><a href="https://www.facebook.com/national.funding"><img alt="" src="https://c.na6.content.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=01580000001WNEu&amp;oid=00D80000000diq5" align="left" border="0"></a><a href="http://www.linkedin.com/company/national-funding"><img alt="" src="https://c.na6.content.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=01580000001WNFn&amp;oid=00D80000000diq5" align="left" border="0"></a><a href="https://twitter.com/NatFunding"><img alt="" src="https://c.na6.content.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=01580000001WNFx&amp;oid=00D80000000diq5" align="left" border="0"></a><a title="Google+" href="https://plus.google.com/+Nationalfunding/" target="_blank" alt="Google+"><img src="https://c.na6.content.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=01580000001Xf1W&amp;oid=00D80000000diq5&amp;lastMod=1363900191000"></a></p></div>]]></td>
